	(text "Outputs only. EN_3V3_Sn / EN_5V_Sn / EN_5V_KVM: 100k pull-downs at the switches (rails off after a\npower-on); BUSEN_N_Sn: 10k pull-ups at the bus switches (open). The firmware declares every one\nGPIO_OUTPUT_INACTIVE, never a bare GPIO_OUTPUT (SPEC §8.4). INT not used."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
